      "content": "i get that but it's probably just a really bad migraine episode right? i get these sometimes where it feels super intense but it always passes. i really don't want to go to the er if i don't have to, it's such a hassle. if i just take an extra pill and lay down in a dark room for a couple hours, that should be fine, right? it's just the headache that's killing me.",
